MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the menu bar, status bar and side panels with a 42 px top bar
(project menu on the mark, Schematic | Cabinet, breadcrumb, Search or run,
saved state), a page outline that pins above 1700 px and floats as a flyout
below, a HUD with the cursor position and toasts for messages. Adds focus
mode (Ctrl+Shift+F), full screen (F11) and Pin outline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AYuFPxz6eQReQdtzYKLMmW
